<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Domion - Next Generation DDD</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        @keyframes bounce-slow {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(5px); }
        }
        .animate-bounce-slow {
            animation: bounce-slow 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#020617] text-white">
    <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Background Glow -->
        <div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] bg-blue-600/20 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] bg-cyan-600/20 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>

        <div class="max-w-5xl w-full text-center z-10">
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-8 animate-bounce-slow">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 drop-shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(14,165,233,0.5)]" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M50 5L89.4019 28.75V71.25L50 95L10.5981 71.25V28.75L50 5Z" stroke="url(#paint0_linear_blade)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    <rect x="35" y="45" width="8" height="30" rx="2" fill="url(#paint1_linear_blade)" />
                    <rect x="46" y="30" width="8" height="45" rx="2" fill="white" />
                    <rect x="57" y="45" width="8" height="30" rx="2" fill="url(#paint2_linear_blade)" />
                    <defs>
                        <linearGradient id="paint0_linear_blade" x1="50" y1="5" x2="50" y2="95" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                            <stop stop-color="#0EA5E9"/>
                            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#2563EB"/>
                        </linearGradient>
                        <linearGradient id="paint1_linear_blade" x1="39" y1="45" x2="39" y2="75" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                            <stop stop-color="#7DD3FC"/>
                            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0EA5E9"/>
                        </linearGradient>
                        <linearGradient id="paint2_linear_blade" x1="61" y1="45" x2="61" y2="75" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                            <stop stop-color="#7DD3FC"/>
                            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0EA5E9"/>
                        </linearGradient>
                    </defs>
                </svg>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-8xl font-black mb-6 tracking-tighter bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-blue-100 to-cyan-400">
                DOMION
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-400 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-medium leading-relaxed">
                The <span class="text-cyan-400">Enterprise Framework</span> for modern Laravel developers. 
                Building scalable Domain-Driven architectures has never been this beautiful.
            </p>
            
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6">
                <a href="{{ route('login') }}" class="group relative px-10 py-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 rounded-2xl font-bold text-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(14,165,233,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 active:scale-95">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        Launch Project
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
                    </span>
                </a>
                
                <a href="https://github.com/samushi/domion" target="_blank" class="px-10 py-4 bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors duration-300">
                    View Source
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-24 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-7xl w-full z-10">
            <div class="group p-8 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/10">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Domain Isolation</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Zero-config domain isolation that keeps your business logic perfectly decoupled.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="group p-8 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/10">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Action Factories</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Reusable, single-responsibility actions that replace bloated controllers.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="group p-8 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/10">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Clean Blade</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-normal">Traditional Blade with modern aesthetics. Fast, familiar, and powerful.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
